lass=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">How to Name Your Canary — Complete Guide 🐦</span></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/guide/fantasy-reptiles-names/\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">📖</span><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Fantasy Reptiles Names — 100+ Ideas 💫</span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">📝 Related Articles</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-habitat/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🌍</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Habitat: Forests, Oceans, Deserts &amp; More 🌍</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the perfect animal names inspired by different habitats around the world. From deep ocean dwellers to desert survivors, find names rooted in nature&#x27;s most beautiful landscapes.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-color/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🎨</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names by Color: 200+ Ideas for Every Shade 🎨</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Find the perfect name based on your pet&#x27;s color! From snow-white names to midnight-black names, explore 200+ color-inspired animal names organized by every shade of the rainbow.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⚡</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names Inspired by Mythology: Gods, Heroes &amp; Legends ⚡</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Name your pet after the gods, heroes, and mythical creatures of world mythology. From Greek and Norse to Egyptian and Japanese legends, find powerful, meaningful names.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/animal-names-that-mean-strength/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">💪</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Animal Names That Mean Strength: Powerful Names for Mighty Pets 💪</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Give your pet a name that embodies power, courage, and resilience. Discover 150+ animal names that mean strength from languages and cultures around the world.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-exotic-pets/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🦎</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names for Exotic Pets: Unique Ideas for Rare Companions 🦎</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Naming an exotic pet requires special creativity. From reptiles and amphibians to sugar gliders and hedgehogs, discover perfectly unique names for your rare companion.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-animal-names-for-aquatic-pets/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐠</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Naming Tips</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Best Animal Names for Aquatic Pets: Fish, Turtles &amp; More 🐠</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Dive into the best names for your aquatic companions. From goldfish and bettas to turtles and axolotls, discover 200+ creative water-inspired pet names.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/clever-nazca-booby-names-inspired-by-literature-50-clever-ideas-for-your-nazca-booby/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Clever Nazca Booby Names Inspired by Literature: 50+ Clever Ideas for Your Nazca Booby</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/animal-naming-traditions-around-the-world/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">Animal Naming Traditions Around the World: How Different Cultures Name Their Pets</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-