 Animal Names by Habitat: Forests, Oceans, Deserts & More 🌍\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Discover the perfect animal names inspired by different habitats around the world. From deep ocean dwellers to desert survivors, find names rooted in nature's most beautiful landscapes.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"best-animal-names-by-color\",{\"href\":\"/blog/best-animal-names-by-color/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🎨\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Naming Tips\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Best Animal Names by Color: 200+ Ideas for Every Shade 🎨\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Find the perfect name based on your pet's color! From snow-white names to midnight-black names, explore 200+ color-inspired animal names organized by every shade of the rainbow.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology\",{\"href\":\"/blog/best-animal-names-inspired-by-mythology/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"⚡\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Naming Tips\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Best Animal Names Inspired by Mythology: Gods, Heroes & Legends ⚡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"